{"sections":[{"slug":"整概形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"整概形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">整概形</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“整概形”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">称满足如下等价条件的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":" $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为整概形</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> Zariski <span lang=\"zh\">开集</span> $U\\subset X$, $\\Gamma(\\mathcal O_X,U)$ <span lang=\"zh\">为整环</span>;</li>\n<li>$X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/既约概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">既约概形</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的底层拓扑空间不可约</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">整概形</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/一般点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">一般点</span>"}},{"Plain":" (generic point) $\\eta$, <span lang=\"zh\">且茎</span> $\\mathcal O_{X,\\eta}$ <span lang=\"zh\">是域</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的有理函数域</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}